{"id":"G2003","lemma":"ἐπιταγή","transliteration":"epitagē","sayIt":"epitagē","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, feminine","gloss":"command","meaning":"ἐπι-ταγή, -ῆς, ἡ\n(ἐπιτάσσω), [in LXX: Dan LXX 3:16 (פִּתְגָּם), I Est.1:18, Wis.14:16 18:16 19:6, 3Ma.7:20 * ;]\n= cl., ἐπίταγμα,\na command, Rom.16:26, 1Co.7:6 7:25, 2Co.8:8, 1Ti.1:1, Tit.1:3 (for use in Inscr. of divine commands, see MM, Exp., xiv); μετὰ πάσης ἐ, with all authority: Tit.2:15.†\n(AS)","glosses":["command","authority"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1co-7","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"a command","kjv":"commandment"}},{"chapterId":"1co-7","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"command","kjv":"commandment"}},{"chapterId":"2co-8","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"a command","kjv":"commandment"}},{"chapterId":"1ti-1","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"the command","kjv":"the commandment"}},{"chapterId":"tit-1","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"the command","kjv":"the commandment"}},{"chapterId":"tit-2","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"authority","kjv":"authority"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Corinthians 7:6","note":"But this I say by way of concession, not of commandment.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Corinthians 8:8","note":"I speak not by way of commandment, but as proving through the earnestness of others the sincerity also of your love.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Timothy 1:1","note":"Paul, an apostle of Jesus Christ according to the commandment of God our Savior and the Lord Jesus Christ our hope;","source":"web"},{"ref":"Titus 1:3","note":"but in his own time revealed his word in the message with which I was entrusted according to the commandment of God our Savior;","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"G20030","lemma":"αἰκισμός","transliteration":"aikismos","gloss":"wrench, shock"},{"id":"G20031","lemma":"αἴλουρος","transliteration":"ailouros","gloss":"cat"},{"id":"G20032","lemma":"αἱμάσσω","transliteration":"ahimassō","gloss":"be bloody"},{"id":"G20033","lemma":"αἱμόρραντος","transliteration":"ahimorrantos","gloss":"blood-sprinkle